{
  "evidence_limits": [
    "Upstream tag/source facts do not attest the installed node systemd build, entrypoint bytes or image build equivalence.",
    "The recorded node prefix identifies systemd major257; existing guest259.9 query color facts are separate.",
    "An authenticated truncated prefix does not prove unseen tail length, source EOF, readiness, native success or retirement.",
    "This presentation change does not establish that a new stream will fit the unchanged16384byte ceiling.",
    "Selected legacy profile presentation effectiveness remains unqualified; each native profile still needs separately admitted evidence."
  ],
  "facts": [
    {
      "fact": "Official systemd v257 parses the explicit string zero as false/COLOR_OFF, ahead of automatic terminal color selection.",
      "id": "fixed-false",
      "source_refs": [
        "src/basic/parse-util.c:23-45",
        "src/basic/string-table.h:29-39",
        "src/basic/terminal-util.c:1478-1534"
      ]
    },
    {
      "fact": "PID 1 initializes ordinary log color from colors_enabled; normal job status highlight decoration follows log_get_show_color. Message generation, severity and show-status decisions are separate.",
      "id": "pid1-and-normal-status",
      "source_refs": [
        "src/core/main.c:3158-3160",
        "src/core/job.c:830-840",
        "src/core/manager.c:4692-4707"
      ]
    },
    {
      "fact": "The retained official kind entrypoint preserves the supplied container environment and execs its command; official image source names that entrypoint and /sbin/init. Kind does not automatically pass arbitrary host environment. Explicit fixed node argv delivery is required.",
      "id": "node-delivery",
      "source_refs": [
        "images/base/files/usr/local/bin/entrypoint:572-574",
        "images/base/Dockerfile:240-247",
        "pkg/cluster/internal/providers/podman/provision.go:132-154"
      ]
    },
    {
      "fact": "TERM-driven ephemeral status/cursor CSI and terminal palette-reset OSC are independent. Selected emergency/end-of-support labels use raw SGR. An explicit SYSTEMD_URLIFY setting can override its default colors-dependent decision. Later log-color configuration can override initial state. No second variable, filtering, quiet level, status suppression or new observer is selected.",
      "id": "not-all-ansi",
      "source_refs": [
        "src/core/show-status.c:95-117",
        "src/basic/terminal-util.c:653-665",
        "src/shared/pretty-print.c:59-96",
        "src/core/main.c:1453",
        "src/core/main.c:2102",
        "src/basic/log.c:1414-1420"
      ]
    },
    {
      "fact": "Existing status ellipsization and ephemeral display behavior remain; source facts support normal color reduction, not an all-ANSI or lossless-output guarantee.",
      "id": "no-lossless-claim",
      "source_refs": ["src/core/show-status.c:107", "src/core/manager.c:4692-4707"]
    }
  ],
